  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Dual Wielder feat got significant updates in the 2024 DnD rules to align with the much more appealing rules for two-weapon fighting. Two-weapon fighting was rarely viable in the 2014 rules, but the advent of the Nick Weapon Mastery has made two-weapon fighting an exciting and powerful combat option. Dual Wielder seeks to improve that capability even further."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you plan to build around two-weapon fighting, be sure that you have Weapon Mastery with a Nick weapon like the Dagger. Dual Wielder is largely pointless without it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
